# Security headers for every page. Cloudflare applies this file on deploy.
# The CSP lists exactly what the pages load: Tailwind and Phosphor from CDNs,
# Inter from Google Fonts, the Supabase waitlist function, and Cloudflare Web
# Analytics (cookieless; Cloudflare injects its beacon on the live domain). Add a host here
# before the page starts loading something new, or the browser will block it.
#
# Framing: only victoryang.xyz (Victor's portfolio, which previews this site in a
# tab) may embed the page; everyone else is refused by frame-ancestors. There is no
# X-Frame-Options line on purpose: it cannot name an allowed site, and older
# browsers that only know it would otherwise refuse the portfolio too.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.tailwindcss.com https://unpkg.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://unpkg.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com https://unpkg.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co https://cloudflareinsights.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors https://victoryang.xyz https://www.victoryang.xyz
